[G6.9]  Boot from internal ROM / IMEM passes
        Status  : DONE
        Evidence: soc_boot_sanity_test executed in QuestaSim. RV32IM core booted
                  from internal IMEM (0x0000_0000), fetched ADDI and M-extension
